 | -59489.871 ± 433.145 | 8285.5625 ± 3.7021 | 1430 |\n| Ru-118 | 74 | -57000# ± 200# | 8263# ± 2# | 1446 |\n| Ru-119 | 75 | -52080# ± 300# | 8220# ± 3# | 1462 |\n| Ru-120 | 76 | -49720# ± 400# | 8199# ± 3# | 1478 |\n| Ru-121 | 77 | -44620# ± 400# | 8156# ± 3# | 1494 |\n| Ru-122 | 78 | -41780# ± 500# | 8132# ± 4# | 1511 |\n| Ru-123 | 79 | -36550# ± 500# | 8089# ± 4# | 1527 |\n| Ru-124 | 80 | -33590# ± 600# | 8065# ± 5# | 1543 |\n| Ru-125 | 81 | -28370# ± 300# | 8023# ± 2# | 1560 |\n\n## Q-values and separation energies\n\n| Nuclide | Qβ− / keV | Qα / keV | S₂n / keV | S₂p / keV | Reaction-file line |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---:|\n| Ru-85 | UNKNOWN (*) | -1595# ± 707# | UNKNOWN (*) | -1132# ± 641# | 952 |\n| Ru-86 | UNKNOWN (*) | -1825# ± 565# | UNKNOWN (*) | 178# ± 499# | 967 |\n| Ru-87 | UNKNOWN (*) | -1815# ± 566# | 31242# ± 640# | 2798# ± 400# | 981 |\n| Ru-88 | -17479# ± 500# | -2594# ± 423# | 30712# ± 500# | 4807# ± 300# | 995 |\n| Ru-89 | -12719# ± 361# | -3284.5795 ± 28.9364 | 28782# ± 400# | 6062.5489 ± 24.3868 | 1009 |\n| Ru-90 | -13250# ± 200# | -3197.7899 ± 4.7446 | 26687# ± 300# | 6775.1902 ± 5.3387 | 1023 |\n| Ru-91 | -9670# ± 298# | -3779.9314 ± 3.6188 | 26013.0449 ± 24.3205 | 7802.8307 ± 4.4987 | 1037 |\n| Ru-92 | -11302.1155 ± 5.1531 | -4039.5737 ± 4.6875 | 25560.0458 ± 4.6155 | 8706.6386 ± 4.4019 | 1051 |\n| Ru-93 | -8204.9136 ± 3.3425 | -4626.6950 ± 4.4237 | 25119.5266 ± 3.0324 | 9585.8312 ± 6.5709 | 1065 |\n| Ru-94 | -9675.9789 ± 4.6150 | -4836.0038 ± 4.6763 | 24425.0276 ± 4.1553 | 10352.9572 ± 3.1470 | 1079 |\n| Ru-95 | -5117.1423 ± 10.2656 | -3673.8405 ± 11.3665 | 22383.6716 ± 9.7235 | 11228.6219 ± 9.5035 | 1094 |\n| Ru-96 | -6392.6529 ± 10.0000 | -1696.7139 ± 0.2313 | 19639.4191 ± 3.1477 | 12244.2479 ± 0.1597 | 1108 |\n| Ru-97 | -3523.0000 ± 35.3553 | -1738.4011 ± 2.7686 | 18805.4416 ± 9.8925 | 12986.6340 ± 2.7605 | 1123 |\n| Ru-98 | -5049.6529 ± 10.0000 | -2235.7080 ± 6.4640 | 18287.1224 ± 6.4647 | 14007.9242 ± 6.4636 | 1138 |\n| Ru-99 | -2040.